      "answer_outline": "The candidate should describe defining infrastructure as code, managing state, and using modules for reusability. For the troubleshooting part, they should mention inspecting pod logs, checking events, or analyzing resource limits/quotas to identify the root cause.",
      "difficulty": 2
    }
